<BaseLayout title="Support Open Your AIs" description="Help Ulisses keep testing creative AI tools and sharing practical articles and free skills." current="support">
<main class="container support-page">
<p class="mono" style="color:var(--c-accent)">Reader support · Open Your AIs</p>
<h1>Help me make the next experiment worth sharing.</h1>
<p class="intro">If something here helped you create, you can help keep this work going.</p>
<div class="prose">
<p>I'm Ulisses. Open Your AIs is where I share what I learn while making images, films and creative projects with AI. Behind each article are choices to make, tools to try and attempts that don't work out.</p>
<p>Your support helps me devote time and resources to that process: testing ideas in real projects, documenting what I learn and turning those experiences into resources you can use.</p>
<h2>More work to make. More to share.</h2>
<p>Toninho Sagatiba began with stories I recorded for friends. Bringing those voices into a film gave me a process to share: character references, scene direction and the decisions that hold a project together. That's the kind of work I want to keep doing here.</p>
<p>If you found an idea worth trying, a workflow that helped or a skill you can use, consider making a one-time contribution.</p>
<section class="editorial-cta" aria-label="Optional contribution through Stripe">
<p class="editorial-cta__eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR AMOUNT · USD</p>
<h2>Help fund the next round of work.</h2>
<p>US$5 is a suggested starting point. Choose what works for you at checkout, from US$1. Your contribution supports the time and tools behind Open Your AIs.</p>
<p class="editorial-cta__actions"><a class="editorial-cta__button" href="https://buy.stripe.com/8x27sK32Q31ubaAcfEcQU00" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contribute via Stripe →</a></p>
<p class="editorial-cta__disclosure">Secure checkout through Stripe. One-time support, with no subscription.</p>
</section>
<h2>The free resources stay free.</h2>
<p>Contributing is entirely optional. You can read the articles and download the free skills whether you support the site or not. Thank you for reading, trying the methods and making your own work.</p>
<p><a href="/skills/gauntlet-loop.zip" download>Download Gauntlet Loop free ↓</a> · <a href="/blog/">Read the articles →</a></p>
</div>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
